  "translation": "Na taim tanim bilong wanwan yangpela meri i kamap bilong kam insait long king Ahashueros, bihain long taim em i stap olsem lo bilong ol meri — twelvpela mun, long wanem oltaim ol dei bilong wasim bilong ol i pulap: sikispela mun wantaim oil bilong mura, na sikispela mun wantaim ol perfium, na wantaim ol samting bilong wasim bilong ol meri.",
